The dataset includes material derived from:
  - Princeton Geniza Project datasets, Version v1.1 (CC BY-NC 4.0),
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18716581
  - MiDRASH Automatic Transcriptions of the Cairo Geniza Fragments
    (CC BY 4.0), https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17734473
  - Cambridge Digital Library (CUDL) metadata (CC0 1.0)
  - GenizahSearch catalogue table, Hillel Gershuni / Dicta (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0),
    https://github.com/gershuni/GenizahSearch
  - Scholarly editions behind each PGP transcription, credited per
    record in the `edCredit` field
Please credit these sources when you use NAGiD.
